    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Sharon et al. (2002) Nature / Audoly & Boudaoud (2003) PRL Non-Euclidean Edge Buckling Cascades in Ruffled Leaf Margins — Code-to-model traceability: 61/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Cites Sharon et al. (2002), Audoly & Boudaoud (2003), and Liang & Mahadevan (2009) in module docstring, but lacks function-level equation mappings to the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_067_ripping_leaf_edge_waves.lean`." ;
